          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How do I read the mower's grass collection bag indicator?",
            "text": "<p>The grass collection bag full indicator is a small orange flap located on the side of the grass collection box.1. If the grass collection box is empty or it is not full with grass, the grass full indicator flap will remain open.2. When this flap remains closed it means that the grass collection box is full and needs to be emptied.</p>",
