        "entry_nTBGb9": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Why has my mower started to vibrate?",
            "text": "<p>This can happen if the steel blade has been damaged.</p><p>1. Stop the motor, disconnect the power source, and inspect the blade. If the blade is worn replace it.</p><p>2. If the blade is in good condition, check the tightness of the blade screw and re-tighten if necessary.</p>",
